      "type": "SHOT_SCOPE",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Three ways to take a photo, and here is the thing. They don't hand you the same picture at all. The first grabs whatever fits on screen right now. That's it. The second scrolls your entire page, top to bottom, and stitches the whole lot into one tall image. And the third? One element. Nothing around it.",
