      "type": "FIXTURE_CREW",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Remember the dressing room, back in episode eight? Video's a setting on that. Not on the page, not on the browser. The recording kicks off the instant your context gets created, and the file only lands on disk when that same context closes again. So the dressing room is the thing wearing the camera. Everything happening on the stage inside ends up on the tape.",
