      "type": "RULE_TEST",
      "transition": "slide",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Notice the wording on that flag, because the wording really matters. Retain on failure records everything, then quietly deletes whatever passed. Ninety videos of green tests? That's just disk space you pay for and never open. Be honest. Have you ever watched one?",
